    "description": "## Objective\n\nGuided screen flow a Brand Ambassador launches from a Sign-Up record to capture deposit/bet details and set the Status to Completed.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Screen flow launched from a Sign-Up quick action (top-of-page button): capture Sign-Up Date, Deposit DateTime/Amount, First Bet DateTime/Amount, set Status = Completed\n* Optional second path if time allows: Flag Sign-Up, capturing Fraud/Invalid Reason\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* A rep can complete a Sign-Up end-to-end from the button without editing raw fields\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nComplete one Sign-Up via the flow.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nFull status transition rules and payout code generation (BUILD-05).\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n* Buttons are top-of-page native placement; side-panel button placement per the UI mockup requires a custom Lightning component and is out of scope.\n\n---\n\nEstimate: S · \\~3h · Dependencies: POC-10 · Ticket POC-13 (approved 2026-07-04)",
